# Terms the platform map must never render. One per line, or comma-separated;
# blank lines and #-comments ignored. Matching is word-boundary and
# case-insensitive, so "acme" does not flag "acmefoo"; a trailing "*" means
# prefix match, so "widget*" covers widgets/widgetry as one entry.
#
# Copy this file to banned_terms.local (gitignored) and put the real strings
# there. They are deliberately NOT in this repository: a published list of the
# words you are avoiding identifies them exactly as well as using them would.
# PORTFOLIO_BANNED_TERMS="a,b,c" overrides the file.

example-employer
example-erp-vendor
example-brand
example-internal-codename
example-personal-project*
